{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_0136069ddd146a00-2585\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>TVB熱播劇《死有對証》昨（14日）晚播出的集數中，幾位酒吧靚女羅雪妍、莫韻諰及張盈悅一出場即吸引不少觀眾目光。原來三位演員均是港姐出身，其中羅雪妍與張盈悅更憑藉《愛·回家之開心速遞》的Gigi與怪雞Fanny而成功入屋。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_0136069ddd146a00-2585\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"80db48e3-14f4-4ffe-a302-26cb68985cfd.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20262lEGCN3PcT1789465512.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"80db48e3-14f4-4ffe-a302-26cb68985cfd.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"eb8da703-4fcf-4d44-bf48-442dbe84e4b1.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026EoT8FgIPnQ1789465513.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"eb8da703-4fcf-4d44-bf48-442dbe84e4b1.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"22020849-e37a-48e2-8404-86b4c99f3060.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026VoJVKaI7NJ1789465515.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"22020849-e37a-48e2-8404-86b4c99f3060.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_0136069ddd146a00-2585\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>羅雪妍：多重身分的資深瑜伽導師</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_0136069ddd146a00-2586\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>羅雪妍（Uki）外貌清純甜美，2020年參選港姐入行後，憑藉處境劇《愛·回家》的接龍小花Gigi一角入屋。她還曾飾演《痞子無間道》歌女、《金式森林》律師樓秘書及《正義女神》的記者等角色。除了演員、六合彩主持身分外，她更是擁有10年經驗的資深瑜伽導師，練就一身零贅肉Fit爆身材，令人稱羨。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_0136069ddd146a00-2586\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6f0dd53a-8bd7-4f87-aa51-89d3e0f40556.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026WXJR5MnxfC1789465514.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6f0dd53a-8bd7-4f87-aa51-89d3e0f40556.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_0136069ddd146a00-2586\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>張盈悅：《愛·回家》騎呢秘書「怪雞Fanny」</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_0136069ddd146a00-2587\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>與羅雪妍同為2020年港姐的張盈悅（Joyce），憑藉《愛·回家》中飾演林淑敏（大小姐）的騎呢秘書「怪雞Fanny」一角大受歡迎，劇中與Terry李偉健組成的搞笑CP更令人印象深刻。近年她亦客串參演《奪命提示》、《正義女神》及《香港探秘地圖》等多部劇集，可塑性極高。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_0136069ddd146a00-2587\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ab23c4e7-c856-4a34-98a7-62f7d5287c36.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Td4Qw9SiBc1789465514.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ab23c4e7-c856-4a34-98a7-62f7d5287c36.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'>莫韻諰：曾任模特兒 體脂率曾低至16%</p><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_0136069ddd146a00-2588\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>莫韻諰（Vincy）畢業於加拿大西安大略大學，曾任職模特兒，是2021年香港小姐競選的12強佳麗。她去年在《金式森林》以索爆泳衣造型亮相，令觀眾大飽眼福，隨後在《香港探秘地圖》飾演阮政峰女友，性感嫵媚形象深入民心。自小熱愛運動的她，6歲學習高爾夫球，小學已是沙灘排球校隊代表，並參與不少國際賽事，長年運動的她擁有fit到漏的健美身形，全盛時期體脂率更一度低至16%，媲美專業運動員。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_0136069ddd146a00-2588\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2a472201-560d-4ff7-94c8-5c71c1b16581.jpeg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026OU9nduSv3U1789465514.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2a472201-560d-4ff7-94c8-5c71c1b16581.jpeg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_0136069ddd146a00-2588\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_0136069ddd146a00-2588\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T10:21:03.436964+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":642,"images":6,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}